        'speech-studio':`<div class="retro-work-app retro-speech-studio"><header><small>CURIOID LANGUAGE TOOLS / VOCAL LEXICON</small><h3>Pronunciation Script Studio</h3><p>Inspect syllables, stress patterns and phonetic sounds using Echonoise's 125,093-headword Vocal Lexicon. You can also hear your text through a voice supplied by your browser or operating system.</p></header><textarea data-speech-text rows="7" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Write a line, lyric or short script to analyze…">The quiet stars are learning how to sing.</textarea><div class="retro-work-toolbar"><button type="button" data-speech-play>Analyze pronunciation</button><button type="button" data-speech-save>Save report to C:</button><span data-speech-status role="status" aria-live="polite">READY / LOCAL ANALYSIS</span></div><section class="retro-speech-voice-controls" aria-label="Speech playback"><label>Browser voice<select data-speech-voice aria-label="Choose a browser or device voice"><option value="">Default voice</option></select></label><label>Speaking rate<select data-speech-rate aria-label="Speaking rate"><option value="0.75">Slow · 0.75×</option><option value="0.9" selected>Steady · 0.9×</option><option value="1">Normal · 1×</option><option value="1.15">Quick · 1.15×</option><option value="1.3">Fast · 1.3×</option></select></label><button type="button" data-speech-speak>Speak text</button><button type="button" data-speech-stop>Stop voice</button><button type="button" data-speech-clear>Clear text</button></section><p class="retro-speech-privacy">Speech playback uses a voice exposed by your browser or operating system. Some voices are remote services and may send text to their provider. Playback only starts when you press Speak; choose a voice only for text you are comfortable sending to that provider.</p><pre data-speech-output class="retro-speech-output">Your phonetic report will appear here.</pre></div>`
