      if(id==='arrangement')body=`<div class="eno-app-toolbar"><span>SONG EDITOR / PATTERN ARRANGEMENT</span><span data-eno-arrangement-length>4 BARS</span></div><p class="eno-muted">Each bar plays one of your four step patterns. Change the pattern assigned to a bar, add or remove bars, then press Play to hear the complete arrangement.</p><div class="eno-arrangement-track" data-eno-arrangement-track></div><div class="eno-arrangement-actions"><button type="button" data-eno-action="arr-add-bar">＋ Add bar</button><button type="button" data-eno-action="arr-remove-bar">− Remove last bar</button><button type="button" data-eno-action="arr-reset">Reset arrangement</button></div><div class="eno-arrangement-legend"><span><i class="eno-arr-a"></i> Pattern A</span><span><i class="eno-arr-b"></i> Pattern B</span><span><i class="eno-arr-c"></i> Pattern C</span><span><i class="eno-arr-d"></i> Pattern D</span></div><div class="eno-app-actions"><button type="button" data-eno-action="play">▶ Play arrangement</button><button type="button" data-eno-action="stop">■ Stop</button><button type="button" data-eno-action="export-midi">↓ Export MIDI</button></div><p class="eno-muted">Arrangement changes are included in saved sessions and MIDI exports. The loop repeats until you press Stop.</p>`;
