    const removeLexiconCapabilities=()=>{['echonoise.lexicon.analyze','echonoise.lexicon.lookup','echonoise.lexicon.compare','echonoise.lexicon.palette','echonoise.lexicon.rhymes','echonoise.lexicon.stress-match','echonoise.lexicon.fingerprint','echonoise.lexicon.phoneme-search'].forEach(id=>CurioidKernel.unregisterCapability(id,'echonoise-os'));if(window.CurioidLexicon?.version==='3.0.0')delete window.CurioidLexicon;};
    function updateClock(){const n=new Date(),time=n.toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}),date=n.toLocaleDateString([], {weekday:'long',year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric'});const clock=$e('[data-eno-clock]'),tray=$e('[data-eno-tray-clock]'),topDate=$e('[data-eno-date]'),d=$e('[data-eno-clock-date]'),t=$e('[data-eno-clock-time]');if(clock)clock.textContent=n.toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit'});if(tray)tray.textContent=time;if(topDate)topDate.textContent=n.toLocaleDateString([], {weekday:'short',month:'short',day:'numeric'}).toUpperCase();if(d)d.textContent=date;if(t)t.textContent=time;}
    restore();applyTheme(safeGet('curioid-echonoise-theme-v1','neon'));syncUI();renderSteps();renderPatternBanks();updateClock();syncMuteButton();updateTaskbar();setMasterVolume(masterVolume*100);clockTimer=setInterval(updateClock,1000);
