          <div class="aether-overview" data-a-overview><div class="aether-stat-grid"><div><b data-a-stat-nodes>0</b><span>NODES</span></div><div><b data-a-stat-threads>0</b><span>THREADS</span></div><div><b data-a-stat-files>0</b><span>FILES</span></div></div><p>Aether is a local cognitive environment: it finds explainable relationships, makes source-linked extracts and maps knowledge through time. It is not sentient and does not invent facts; you remain the editor.</p><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>DREAM ENGINE / SEMANTIC CONSTELLATIONS</b><span>Local similarity + shared evidence</span><small>Suggests connections using titles, tags, URLs and text you add. Suggestions are reversible and never silently become pinned facts.</small></div><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>SYNTHESIS / EVIDENCE DESK</b><span>Extractive, traceable, offline</span><small>Builds a new note from selected and related source cards, preserving source titles and excerpts. It does not call a cloud model or generate unsupported claims.</small></div><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>ADAPTIVE COMPUTE</b><span data-a-compute-status>Checking available browser capabilities…</span><small>Uses a local worker and IndexedDB/OPFS. WebGPU is optional and never required for core operation.</small></div><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>LOCAL VAULT</b><span data-a-storage-detail>Workspaces use IndexedDB. Attachments use OPFS when available, with an IndexedDB fallback.</span><span data-a-persistence-label>Checking browser persistence…</span><button type="button" data-a-persist>Ask browser to preserve storage</button></div><div class="aether-inspector-card aether-minimap-card"><b>SPATIAL NAVIGATOR</b><svg data-a-minimap viewBox="0 0 2600 1800" role="img" aria-label="Workspace map. Select a point to move the canvas."><rect x="0" y="0" width="2600" height="1800" rx="24" fill="#0a101a"/><g data-a-minimap-edges></g><g data-a-minimap-nodes></g><rect data-a-minimap-view x="0" y="0" width="500" height="350" rx="18" fill="rgba(141,233,228,.08)" stroke="#8de9e4" stroke-width="18"/></svg><small>Click anywhere in the map to center the canvas on that area.</small></div><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>SPATIAL RENDERER</b><span>Browser-native cards + SVG connections</span><small>The canvas pans and zooms with a single transform. Off-screen cards are culled from interaction and paint. WebGPU is not required or claimed by this build.</small></div><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>WORKSPACE BOUNDS</b><span>Up to 300 nodes · 2,000 pinned threads · 100 files / 256 MB per add (64 MB each)</span><small>Up to 80 local workspaces. These practical limits keep the browser canvas responsive; this is not a million-node GPU scene.</small></div><div class="aether-inspector-card"><b>QUICK KEYS</b><span>Space + drag · Pan</span><span>Wheel · Zoom</span><span>Double-click · Open node</span><span>Ctrl / ⌘ + K · Search</span></div></div>
